/**
 * The twelve brand icons, from page 6 of the guide.
 *
 * Generated by scripts/brand/build_icons.py, which also writes the
 * downloadable SVGs in public/brand/icons. Do not edit by hand.
 *
 * fills    aqua shapes, drawn two units down and right of the line
 * lines    the pen line, 2.4 wide on the 48 grid
 * solids   small filled marks in the line colour
 * knocked  filled marks with a ground coloured outline, so they sit
 *          on top of the drawing (the cursor, the notification)
 * detail   the one small thing that makes the icon ours, dropped
 *          below 24px so the shape still reads
 */

